flowchart LR
    CS[Central System]
    O[Orchestrator]
    Cart[Create Cart Service]
    Update[Update Cart Service]
    Inv[Update Inventory Service]
    
    subgraph Kafka Topics
        CT[CartService.topic]
        UT[UpdateCart.topic]
        IT[Inventory.topic]
        ST[Saga.topic]
        RT[Rollback.topic]
    end
    
    %% Initial request
    CS -->|1. Create Order Request| O
    
    %% Parallel service execution through dedicated topics
    O -->|2a. Create Cart Command| CT
    O -->|2b. Update Cart Command| UT
    O -->|2c. Update Inventory Command| IT
    
    %% Services reading their topics
    CT --> Cart
    UT --> Update
    IT --> Inv
    
    %% Services updating saga status
    Cart -->|3a. Update Status| ST
    Update -->|3b. Update Status| ST
    Inv -->|3c. Update Status| ST
    
    %% Orchestrator monitoring
    ST -->|4. Monitor Status| O
    
    %% Rollback flow on failure
    O -->|5. Send Rollback Commands| RT
    RT -->|6a. Rollback| Cart
    RT -->|6b. Rollback| Update
    RT -->|6c. Rollback| Inv
    
    %% Final status update
    Cart -->|7a. Update Rollback Status| ST
    Update -->|7b. Update Rollback Status| ST
    Inv -->|7c. Update Rollback Status| ST
    
    %% Final response
    O -->|8. Final Status| CS
    
    classDef service fill:#f96,stroke:#333
    classDef topic fill:#bbf,stroke:#333
    class Cart,Update,Inv service
    class CT,UT,IT,ST,RT topic
